# Architecture Rules

- `apps/` must not depend on other `apps/`.
- `packages/` must not depend on `apps/`.
- No circular dependencies.
- Domain logic must not live in UI components.
- Domain layer must be framework-agnostic.
- Components must remain thin and focused.
- Shared logic must reside in `packages/core/`.
- Avoid tight coupling between modules.
- Navigation logic must be isolated.
- Violations must be logged to memorybank as drift entries.
